&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;SATA Version is: SATA 2.6, 3.0 Gb/s &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;current: 3.0 Gb/s&lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
